 📈 The dashboard: The S&amp;P 500 closed up 0.4%.

 The index ends the week down 1.4% 📉. It's up 12.1% on the year. 📈 🔥 Today's stock spotlight: Robinhood Markets (+13.7%) benefited along with other crypto related stocks on broad advances for cryptocurrencies.

 
 
